  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the disaster risk management capacities of Caritas Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progressio is implementing since September 2010 the project &#x201c;Rebuilding a new and all-inclusive Haiti: strengthening Haitian civil society in rebuilding their country&#x201d; with the support of CAFOD. During discussion between CAFOD and Caritas Haiti, the need was identified at Caritas Haiti to strengthen their operational and institutional capacities in their response to the earthquake in January 2010. Under this framework and taking into account that Caritas is developing several projects on disaster risk reduction in the capital as a result of the quake, CAFOD and Caritas requested Progressio a development worker expert in disaster risk management, in order to build their capacity in this field.
The overall goal of this secondment is to strengthen the coordination, the technical and the organizational capacities of Caritas Haiti National Office so they can better support their regional offices (diocesan) in the implementation of disaster risk reduction programs and projects</narrative>
  </description>
